*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.map binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# Keep the vendored zlib header byte-identical to its locked checksum.
/managed_components/espressif__zlib/zlib/zconf.h text eol=lf

# Linux 启动脚本与 systemd 单元必须是 LF：CRLF 会让 shebang 报错、unit 无法解析。
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service.in text eol=lf
